{'symbol': 'XEL', 'date': '2021-06-07 10:40:00', 'title': 'XCEL ENERGY HITS CARBON REDUCTION MILESTONE, REDUCES WATER CONSUMPTION AND PROMOTES ELECTRIC VEHICLES', 'text': "MINNEAPOLIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--XCEL ENERGY ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE COMPANY DELIVERED FOR CUSTOMERS, ACHIEVED KEY CARBON REDUCTION GOALS, SUPPORTED ITS COMMUNITIES AND KEPT CUSTOMER BILLS LOW DESPITE CHALLENGES BROUGHT ON BY THE COVID-19 PANDEMIC, THE ECONOMIC DOWNTURN AND CIVIL UNREST IN THE STATES IT SERVES. THE COMPANY RELEASED ITS 16TH ANNUAL SUSTAINABILITY REPORT, FORMERLY KNOWN AS THE CORPORATE RESPONSIBILITY REPORT. THE NAME CHANGE REFLECTS THE COMPANY'S COMMITMENT TO DELIVERING RELIABLE,"}